# The plain umarell commit the planner router's umarell_jam is built on (the cell planner's umarell_jam/: umarell
# + its fix set + U3's hooks + its own integration patch), for the public sample: deploy/fetch-umarell.sh --jam
# installs it, unpatched and read-only, as /var/lib/factoryos/umarell-<first 7 hex digits> (found by
# deploy/planner-router/umarell_jam.py; umarell_jam patches its own copy). From git (fetch --depth 1 of this commit from
# this URL), or from the installer's optional --umarell-jam-tarball (an offline install: a
# `git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=umarell/` of the commit; FACTORYOS_UMARELL_JAM_TARBALL / _SHA256).
# The public commit, the same as deploy/umarell.pin's (umarell_u3's source and the chat agent's tree); umarell_jam's
# patches are for this commit. Without it umarell_jam is not set up, and its jobs fall back to umarell_u3 (provision-incomplete).
# FactoryOS's internal servers don't read this file: they install their own commit from their pinned archive
# (deploy/umarell-jam-base.txt).
#
# <commit, 40 hex digits>  <git URL>
8a02db9ba7db260366451f8c38bafb378cd65c29 https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-industrial-multi-robot-agents.git
